<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Truck division H1 income down.</title>
<headline>Volvo Truck division H1 income down.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish automotive group Volvo said on Tuesday that operating profit from its truck division fell in the first half of 1997 to 688 million crowns from 1.08 billion crowns in the same period in 1996.  </p>
<p>Volvo said the total European market for heavy trucks was 12 percent lower at mid-1997 than 12 months earlier.</p>
<p>&quot;(Truck) Operations in North America continued to be unprofitable but the rate of loss has been reduced,&quot; Volvo said.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
